  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pilot Sustainable Innovation in Vietnam&apos;s Aquaculture Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of this project is to expedite the sustainable development of aquaculture production in Vietnam through:1.	Identifying viable solutions to enhance aquaculture practices;2.	Contributing to the implementation of Vietnam and the Netherlands&#x2019; commitment to ensure food security by utilizing climate-smart agricultural solutions;3.	Raising awareness among Dutch companies and providing information on potential business opportunities concerning aquaculture development in Vietnam.</narrative>
  </description>
